### HU-FASE2-092 CA1+CA3 — Subir adjunto confidencial (reporte de patología)
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "patientId": {{pacienteId}},
  "documentType": "REPORTE_PATOLOGIA",
  "fileName": "Biopsia_2026-05-07.pdf",
  "description": "Reporte de patología de biopsia. Información sensible.",
  "fileUrl": "https://storage.mednova.local/attachments/BIO-2026-0001.pdf",
  "mimeType": "application/pdf",
  "sizeBytes": 102400,
  "uploadingProfessionalId": {{profesionalId}},
  "documentDate": "2026-05-07",
  "isConfidential": true
}

